  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "why",
      "x": 2320,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 300,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "Black on white, VIBES / CERTIFIED.\n\nTop row: the plain stamp. Bottom row: Notarial's elements borrowed back in, in increasing doses.\n\nThe text placement is rebuilt. Top-arc glyphs grow outward from their baseline and bottom-arc glyphs grow inward, so putting both on one radius lands them in two different bands \u2014 that was the wrongness. Each baseline is now offset half a cap height the other way.\n\nThe waves are placed by their measured bounding box, not by the canvas centre: the artwork's centre is (75.87, 74.05) on a 150 grid, not (75, 75)."
    },
    {
      "id": "history",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 280,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "The six constructions, kept for the record. Field Stamp is the one that was picked."
    }
  ],
